# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites.
#
# Clean URLs (/streets -> /streets.html etc.) are handled AUTOMATICALLY by Pages,
# so the per-page .html rewrites from vercel.json are not needed here.
#
# SPA-style catch-all: preserve Vercel's `/(.*) -> /index.html` behavior so unknown
# paths render the homepage instead of a bare 404. Status 200 = rewrite (URL stays).
# Static assets and Pages Functions (/api/*) are matched BEFORE this fallback, so
# real pages and API routes are never shadowed.
#
# NOTE: this makes unknown paths soft-404 (home, 200). If real 404s are preferred
# later, add a 404.html to the build and drop this line.
/*    /index.html    200
